---
/**
 * HomeFeatures.astro - Three-column feature column layout
 * Highlights key company selling points: Sourcing, Production, and QA audits.
 */
---

<section class="hero-features-section">
    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-col">
            <div class="feature-icon-outer">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-circle"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14 9 11"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Trusted Sourcing</h3>
            <p>Access our vetted network of certified fabric mills and manufacturing hubs across India.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-col">
            <div class="feature-icon-outer">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-circle"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14 9 11"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Effortless Production</h3>
            <p>From initial sampling to bulk shipping, we handle the entire logistics pipeline seamlessly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-col">
            <div class="feature-icon-outer">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-circle"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14 9 11"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Quality Assurance</h3>
            <p>Strict in-line inspections and final AQL audits to secure delivery schedules and specs.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
